+/*
+ * Storage layout (Cloudflare KV)
+ * ------------------------------------------------------------------
+ * Each user / deposit lives under its OWN key, so approving a deposit
+ * or updating one user's balance never requires reading + rewriting
+ * every other record. This avoids write conflicts and keeps writes
+ * cheap regardless of how many users/deposits exist.
+ *
+ *   user:<id>                 -> User (JSON)
+ *   email_idx:<lowercased>    -> userId          (fast email lookup)
+ *   referral_idx:<CODE>       -> userId           (fast referral lookup)
+ *   user_ids                  -> string[]         (append-only list of all ids, for admin listing)
+ *
+ *   deposit:<id>              -> DepositRequest (JSON)
+ *   txhash_idx:<hash>         -> depositId        (duplicate-submission guard)
+ *   user_deposits:<userId>    -> string[]         (deposit ids belonging to one user)
+ *   deposit_ids                -> string[]        (append-only list of all deposit ids, for admin)
+ * ------------------------------------------------------------------
+ */
+
